     " is an option of ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "SplitDataForSegmentation"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "30fb1a99-bb9f-c441-a907-7c85dd756f03"],
     ". Has to be a value between 0 and 0.2 and defines how much the left\n\
and right side overlap."
